<title>BOTSWANA: Botswana June consumer inflation up 9.0 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Botswana June consumer inflation up 9.0 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>GABORONE 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Botswana's all items consumer price index rose 0.6 percent in June from May, bringing the year-on-year increase to 9.0 percent, the Central Statistics Office said.</p>
<p>				June 1997	 May 1997	June 1996</p>
<p>    Yr/Yr pct change	9.0		 9.7	   10.4</p>
<p>    All-items index     105.9	     105.3	   97.2</p>
<p>Note - Index November 1996 = 100</p>
<p>-- Gaborone newsroom +267 347182</p>
</text>
